 259:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci_ex.c ****  ===============================================================================
 260:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci_ex.c ****     [..] This section provides the following functions:
 261:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci_ex.c ****      (+) HAL_SCIEx_EnableFifoMode() API enables the FIFO mode
 262:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci_ex.c ****      (+) HAL_SCIEx_DisableFifoMode() API disables the FIFO mode
 263:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci_ex.c ****      (+) HAL_SCIEx_SetTxFifoThreshold() API sets the TX FIFO threshold
 264:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci_ex.c ****      (+) HAL_SCIEx_SetRxFifoThreshold() API sets the RX FIFO threshold
 265:../../../../../../Drivers/PY32E407_HAL_Driver/Src/py32e407_hal_sci_ex.c **** @endverbatim
